        "name": "Umbra Blades",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Every few seconds, Nocturne's next attack strikes surrounding enemies for bonus physical damage and heals himself. <br><br>Nocturne's basic attacks reduce this cooldown.",
        "bodyHtml": "Every 12 seconds, Nocturne's next Attack strikes all nearby enemies for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">([[si:scalead]]120% Attack Damage) physical damage</span> and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">((13 ~ 32) + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power)) Health</span> per target hit.<br /><br />Nocturne's Attacks reduce this Ability's Cooldown by 1 second, increased to 3 against champions and jungle monsters.",
