        "name": "Duskbringer",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Nocturne throws a shadow blade that deals damage, leaves a Dusk Trail, and causes champions to leave a Dusk Trail. While on the trail, Nocturne can move through units and has increased Move Speed and Attack Damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Nocturne throws a shadow blade, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(65/105/145/185/225 + ([[si:scalead]]85% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and leaving a dusk trail for 5 seconds. Enemy champions hit also leave a trail. <br /><br />While on the trail, Nocturne is Ghosted and gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">20/25/30/35/40% Move Speed</span> and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">15/25/35/45/55 Attack Damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Ghosted units can pass through other units.</span>",
