        "name": "Shroud of Darkness",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Nocturne empowers his blades, passively gaining Attack Speed. Activating Shroud of Darkness allows Nocturne to fade into the shadows, creating a magical barrier which blocks a single enemy ability and doubles his passive Attack Speed if successful.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Nocturne gains <span>30/35/40/45/50% Attack Speed</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Nocturne creates a shadow barrier for 1.5 seconds that blocks the next enemy Ability. If an Ability is blocked, this Ability's passive effect is increased to <span>60/70/80/90/100% Attack Speed</span> for 5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability will remain active during <span>Paranoia's</span> flight.</span>",
