        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Nocturne gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">90% Move Speed</span> toward <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Feared</span> enemies.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Nocturne plants a nightmare tether into his target, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/125/170/215/260 + ([[si:scaleap]]100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> over 2 seconds. If the tether remains unbroken, the target is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Feared</span> for 1.25/1.5/1.75/2/2.25 second(s).",
